### Test 1: Get Catalog - Active units
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/getCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Test 2: Get Catalog - By IMEI with details
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/getCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIdentifier": "867530012345678",
  "includeDetails": true
}

### Test 3: Get Catalog - Disabled units
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/getCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitStatus": 0
}
